learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-09T11:59:30.421Z","harness:codex","Preserve raw measurements and failure receipts as evidence. A recovery or comparison normalization must validate its exact contract before use; independently execute the real installed/packed boundary and retain a negative control. Local source acceptance, hosted review, merge, registry publication and GitHub Release advertisement are distinct claims."
